WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.200
My broker asked me for a schedule of the collection.

2
00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:08.000
I sent him a shoebox. Actual receipts, in an actual box.

3
00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:11.900
It took him three weeks.

4
00:00:12.351 --> 00:00:14.791
One tap. Collection inventory.

5
00:00:15.011 --> 00:00:21.878
Every work. Title, artist, medium, year, condition, documented value.

6
00:00:22.098 --> 00:00:27.011
And where each number came from. Invoice. Not a

7
00:00:27.011 --> 00:00:27.728
guess.

8
00:00:27.948 --> 00:00:34.198
Prepared for you, by name. Dated, page numbered, totalled.

9
00:00:34.418 --> 00:00:37.174
Print it, or send it straight to your broker.

10
00:00:37.394 --> 00:00:39.797
The document you hope you never need.

